blurry-a 2026-11-26: opponent.png: the same picture: chess.com profile avatar of slomg (api.chess.com/pub/player/slomg -> images.chesscomfiles.com, 200px max or smaller at source), matched by eye to the video crop, resized to 512px.
blurry-a 2026-11-26: B_b.png, B_w.png, Ch_b.png, Ch_w.png, K_b.png, K_w.png, Knook_b.png, Knook_w.png, N_b.png, N_w.png, P_b.png, P_w.png, R_b.png, R_w.png, T_n.png, U_b.png, U_w.png: no web copy of this video's piece art found; re-rendered from the video sprite at 512px (~90%): Lanczos upscale of the premultiplied colour, light unsharp, hard anti-aliased alpha edge (no fading). Tool /workspace/work/ba/crisp.py crisp_smooth.
s5-art 2026-11-26: Q_w.png, Q_b.png, Iq_w.png, Iq_b.png: the old 128 px video doodles had the side tip balls of the jester crown cut by the crop. Rebuilt with tools/art_s5_jester.py: padded, the crown's own intact tip ball template-matched and pasted onto the cut side balls, pale outer halo removed, re-traced (tools/sprite_vec.py, 2 colours) and recoloured to this set's outline/fill (sampled from K_w/K_b), 512 px centred at 90%.
